---
import {FOX_MASCOT} from '../lib/fallbacks'
---

<section class="w-full py-space-3xl bg-surface" id="about">
  <div class="site-wrap">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-space-xl items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-space-md reveal-on-scroll">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="sticker-chip">LA STORIA • Η ΙΔΕΑ</span>
          <span class="text-xs text-outline uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">EST. ILIOUPOLI ATHENS</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-headline-lg-mobile lg:text-headline-lg text-on-surface font-bold leading-tight text-balance">
          Τρεις φίλες, ένα Spritz bar &amp; η αιώνια ηλιόλουστη διάθεση της Ηλιούπολης.
        </h2>
        <p class="font-title-lg text-title-lg text-primary font-medium italic -mt-2">
          "We built the living room we always dreamed of partying in."
        </p>
        <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          Η Περσόνα γεννήθηκε από τρία κορίτσια που κουράστηκαν από τα συνηθισμένα bars. Θέλαμε ατόφια ιταλική aperitivo
          κουλτούρα: τραγανές focaccia, μυρωδάτα spritz με artisanal bitters, ατελείωτες κουβέντες κάτω από λεμονιές και,
          όσο πέφτει το φως, 80s, 90s και 00s ύμνους που σε κάνουν να σηκώνεσαι από το τραπέζι.
        </p>
        <div
          class="p-space-md bg-surface-container-low rounded-lg shadow-elevation-1 flex items-start gap-space-sm border-l-4 border-primary"
        >
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-3xl">format_quote</span>
          <div class="flex flex-col">
            <span class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold"
              >«Η επόμενη στάση είναι γνωστή.»</span
            >
            <span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-outline italic"
              >Next station: Ilioupoli Sun City. Spritz first, questions later.</span
            >
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-space-sm pt-space-xs">
          {
            [
              {icon: 'favorite', color: 'text-primary', label: '100% Female Founded'},
              {icon: 'local_pizza', color: 'text-secondary', label: 'Open-Flame Pizzaiolo'},
              {icon: 'graphic_eq', color: 'text-tertiary', label: 'Eclectic DJ Grooves'},
            ].map((chip) => (
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-surface-container px-space-sm py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold text-on-surface">
                <span class={`material-symbols-outlined ${chip.color} text-[18px]`}>{chip.icon}</span>
                <span>{chip.label}</span>
              </div>
            ))
          }
          <div
            class="sticker-chip !bg-primary-fixed !text-on-primary-fixed !border-primary/30 rotate-[3deg]"
          >
            128+ ευτυχισμένες φάτσες στους τοίχους μας
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative reveal-on-scroll">
        <div
          class="cursor-pointer group relative bg-cardboard rounded-lg p-space-lg shadow-elevation-2 border border-primary/10 overflow-hidden select-none"
          id="unboxing-box"
          role="button"
          tabindex="0"
          aria-expanded="false"
          aria-label="Unbox Persona secrets"
        >
          <div
            class="absolute -top-3 left-10 bg-primary-fixed text-on-primary-fixed text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest px-4 py-1.5 shadow-md -rotate-3 transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:rotate-0 rounded-tl-none rounded-br-2xl"
            id="tape-banner"
          >
            FRAGILE • SPRITZ INSIDE
          </div>
          <div
            class="absolute -bottom-3 right-6 bg-surface-dim text-on-surface-variant text-[10px] font-mono tracking-widest px-3 py-1 shadow rotate-2"
          >
            BATCH #042-ATH
          </div>
          <div
            class="flex items-center justify-between pb-space-sm mb-space-sm bg-surface-container-highest px-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-lg"
          >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-xl">inventory_2</span>
              <span class="font-label-sticker text-label-sticker text-on-surface tracking-wider uppercase font-bold"
                >UNBOXING PERSONA</span
              >
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs bg-primary text-on-primary px-3 py-0.5 rounded-full font-bold shadow-sm" id="unboxing-badge"
              >Click to Open</span
            >
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm mb-space-md">
            <img
              src={FOX_MASCOT}
              alt=""
              class="w-16 h-16 object-contain rounded-full bg-tangerine p-1.5 shadow-md"
              width="64"
              height="64"
            />
            <div>
              <span class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface block leading-tight">Οι 3 της Περσόνας</span>
              <span class="text-xs text-outline uppercase tracking-wider">Eleni, Maria, Christina</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-3 font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant" id="unboxing-content">
            <div class="p-3 bg-surface-container rounded-lg">
              <strong class="text-primary block font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider"
                >01. Το μυστικό του Spritz:</strong
              >
              <span class="mt-0.5 block"
                >Χειροποίητο σιρόπι περγαμόντο και prosecco από μικρό οινοποιείο στο Veneto.</span
              >
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-surface-container rounded-lg">
              <strong class="text-secondary block font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider"
                >02. Γιατί Αλεπού; (The Mascot):</strong
              >
              <span class="mt-0.5 block"
                >Γιατί είναι παιχνιδιάρα, απρόβλεπτη και ξέρει πού κρύβεται το καλύτερο πάρτι στην πόλη!</span
              >
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 bg-surface-container rounded-lg">
              <strong class="text-tertiary block font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider"
                >03. Vinyl &amp; 00s Anthems:</strong
              >
              <span class="mt-0.5 block">Από Raffaella Carrà μέχρι Gwen Stefani &amp; Nu-Disco edits.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  const unbox = document.getElementById('unboxing-box')
  const tape = document.getElementById('tape-banner')
  const badge = document.getElementById('unboxing-badge')
  let isUnboxed = false

  unbox?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    isUnboxed = !isUnboxed
    unbox.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(isUnboxed))
    if (isUnboxed) {
      unbox.classList.add('ring-4', 'ring-primary')
      if (tape) tape.style.transform = 'translateY(-16px) rotate(-14deg) scale(1.08)'
      if (badge) badge.textContent = 'Unboxed!'
    } else {
      unbox.classList.remove('ring-4', 'ring-primary')
      if (tape) tape.style.transform = ''
      if (badge) badge.textContent = 'Click to Open'
    }
  })
</script>
